<title>UK: Chiroscience to unveil cancer therapy drug - FT.</title>
<headline>Chiroscience to unveil cancer therapy drug - FT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chiroscience Group Plc  is expected to announce on Monday it has identified a cancer therapy which it hopes to put into clinical trials later this year, the Financial Times said on Monday.</p>
<p>It said the therapy would be based on the same technology as British Biotech Plc's  Marimastat, the FT said.</p>
<p>-- Lonmdon Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
</text>
